 },
 "summary": "A six-lead PLCC surface-mount LED holding one red AlInGaP die and one green and one blue InGaN die, each on its own anode and cathode pair and its own heat path. The lens is diffused silicone, the top face is black for contrast, and the typical viewing angle is 120°. At 20 mA the typical intensities are 1000 mcd red, 1900 mcd green and 384 mcd blue; it is intended for indoor full-colour displays and is supplied on tape and reel from one intensity and colour bin per reel.",
